# Defense in depth only (#43).
#
# The deployment package is now built into ./public-web by `npm run build:web`
# and wrangler's assets.directory points there, so the repository root is never
# published. This ignore file still enumerates everything that must never end up
# in a deployment, so a future change of assets.directory cannot silently expose
# source, tooling, the Android project, CI config, release binaries or docs.

android-app/
artifacts/
tests/
tools/
.github/
.git/
.gitignore
.assetsignore
package.json
package-lock.json
bun.lock
README.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md
SECURITY.md
PROJECT_PLAN.md
DOCUMENTATION_TRUTH_AUDIT.md
V1_ACCEPTANCE.md
TASK_TEMPLATES.md
LICENSE
node_modules/
.wrangler/
public-web/
dist/
*.apk
*.aab
*.jks
*.keystore
.env
.env.*
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
